--- !u!114 &1274953824
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1274953822}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8a6828637c11124c9c0472321e9dcb3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScript
  dialogueText: {fileID: 350706591}
  lines:
  - "Detective: Hello Jeff, I\u2019m detective Hughes and I\u2019m here to interrogate
    you if that\u2019s all right with you."
  - "Jeff: Uhhh\u2026 Yeah, so I can get this over with, I\u2019m 100% innocent sir."
  - 'Detective: Where were you on the 31st of October at around 19:00 pm?'
  - 'Jeff: I was at the park. It was Halloween and I wanted to go out.'
  - "Detective: Ok, but why go to the park and not to a bar or something? For someone
    your age with no kids that would be far more appropriate, don\u2019t you think?"
  - "Jeff: I guess, but going out isn\u2019t my cup of tea. I just wanted to make
    the kids at the park happy by giving them some candy."
  - "Detective: I\u2019ve been told that you frequent the park and tried approaching
    kids on multiple occasions, so this isn\u2019t just a one-off thing for Halloween."
  - It has been confirmed that you gave candy to the victim also.
  - "Jeff: I know how bad it looks, but please believe me, I\u2019m innocent. I have
    never done anything to any of the kids and they can tell you that."
  - "Plus, if I really was out to do something like that, don\u2019t you think I
    would have done it much sooner to not draw all this attention on to myself? It
    makes no sense."
  - "Detective: One can never be sure of how a murderer\u2019s brain works, so unfortunately
    that proves nothing. You will be taken into custody while the police gather evidence."
  - "*Jeff\u2019s profile has been added to your suspects folder*."
  textSpeed: 0.05
